    "closed": true,
    "closedAt": "2024-04-12T08:20:23Z",
    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Having LSP show a warning has nothing to do with why it is not working. Replace `mini_pairs_disable` with [`minipairs_disable`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc603f4fe763741969d809ef059bf5ed457ce0e4/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L75) and it should work.\r\n\r\nIf you want to *only* disable `` ` `` in those filetypes, [override its buffer-local mapping](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc603f4fe763741969d809ef059bf5ed457ce0e4/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L30) so that it works as default. So with something like this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\r\n  pattern = { 'gitcommit', 'markdown' },\r\n  callback = function(event) vim.keymap.set('i', '`', '`', { buffer = event.buf }) end,\r\n})\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Having LSP show a warning has nothing to do with why it is not working. Replace <code class=\"notranslate\">mini_pairs_disable</code> with <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc603f4fe763741969d809ef059bf5ed457ce0e4/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L75\"><code class=\"notranslate\">minipairs_disable</code></a> and it should work.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you want to <em>only</em> disable <code class=\"notranslate\">`</code> in those filetypes, <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc603f4fe763741969d809ef059bf5ed457ce0e4/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L30\">override its buffer-local mapping</a> so that it works as default. So with something like this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\n  pattern = { 'gitcommit', 'markdown' },\n  callback = function(event) vim.keymap.set('i', '`', '`', { buffer = event.buf }) end,\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>FileType<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gitcommit<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>markdown<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">event</span>) <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>i<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>`<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>`<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">buffer</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">event</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">buf</span> }) <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n})</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "Having LSP show a warning has nothing to do with why it is not working. Replace mini_pairs_disable with minipairs_disable and it should work.\nIf you want to only disable ` in those filetypes, override its buffer-local mapping so that it works as default. So with something like this:\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\n  pattern = { 'gitcommit', 'markdown' },\n  callback = function(event) vim.keymap.set('i', '`', '`', { buffer = event.buf }) end,\n})",
